      stages: {
        server: d.fn('The Mumble/Murmur server on :64738 (TCP control + UDP voice). secretName holds MUMBLE_SUPERUSER_PASSWORD (envFrom). Data at /data. Expose to clients (often a LoadBalancer); add a second Service for UDP.', [
